  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……あっ！　あの時の！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あのっ、私のこと覚えてますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この子、見覚えがあるな……たしか……\r\n……そうだ！）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "オーディションに参加してくれてた、\r\n園田智代子さんだね",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　そうです！　\r\n覚えててもらえて嬉しいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの時は、すごくお世話になって……！\r\nありがとうございました！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、これから頑張りますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……って言っても、\r\nデビューはまだまだ先だと思いますけど……えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（園田さんの笑顔……素朴だけどすごく可愛いな\r\nこの親しみやすさはきっと武器になる）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……園田さん、良かったら\r\n俺がプロデュースするユニットの一員になってくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えぇっ！？\r\n私がですかっ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "園田さんの笑顔を見たら\r\nどうしても誘いたい、って思ったんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急な話かもしれないけど、どうかな？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "で、でもでも、本当に私でいいんですか？\r\n私、全然普通で……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通なんてことはない\r\n持っているものを活かしてくれればいいんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "持っているもの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "園田さんについて、教えてくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わかりました！\r\nえっと、えーっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は園田智代子で、女子高生で、\r\n友達からはチョコって呼ばれてて、",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チョコ？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　名前が智代子で、チョコって読めるので、\r\nそういうあだ名が……ん？　チョコ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコアイドル、園田智代子！\r\n……なんてどうでしょうか？！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、甘いもの好きですし、ぴったりな気がします！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。いいんじゃないか、チョコアイドル！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ほんとですか！？　嬉しいです！\r\nチョコアイドルが板につくよう、頑張ります！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "板チョコだけに！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、板チョコだけに……？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　こんな感じでチョコに絡めた台詞が言えたら、\r\nチョコアイドル！　って感じがするかと思って……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000002/1010001010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う、うーん……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001010180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よーし……！\r\nそうと決まれば、私、いっぱい考えますね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
